Corpus license
==============

Every file under data/corpus/ is an original, synthetic "internal engineering
handbook" for a fictional company (Larkspur Systems). It was written for this
repository so that the sample corpus has no third-party licensing questions.

The handbook, like the rest of this repository, is released under the MIT
License (see the repository root LICENSE). Any resemblance to a real company,
product, person or policy is coincidental.

To run docs-rag over your own notes, set CORPUS_PATH to a folder of Markdown
or plain-text files.
